 "bodytext": "Custom made, path illumination for the climbing refuge Kalandraka in Rodellar, Spain.\r\nThe 16 different lamps are realized with industrial raw piping elements and designed to <br />illuminate the paths to and from the climbing refuge without causing light pollution.\r\nXIX metal group realization - Idea and concept by Grex Portmann and Maja Thommen<br />Design and realization by Uri Moss, Grex Portmann &amp; M.Thommen in Sennhof, <br />Switzerland, October 2015\r\n",
